The port reimplements JER's behaviour in Rust against Horizon's mod API; it is not a translation of JER's Java
code. It is distributed under JER's licence, which is reproduced unchanged in LICENSE: it may not be used
commercially, and it is not the work of way2muchnoise, who is not responsible for it.

No assets from JER are shipped: its GUI textures are not included (the window is drawn with plain shapes and
the game's own item icons), and the language file is the port's own.

